段没工作的日子都记下起止日期。找到工作后，马上把雇主信息报给学校。难在找工作不顺时，天数会一天天往上涨"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["美国联邦移民法规 8 CFR 214.2(f)(10)(ii)(E) 规定，毕业后的 OPT 期间，身份取决于有没有工作。累计没工作的天数不得超过 90 天。拿到 24 个月 STEM 延期的，整个 OPT 期间合计不得超过 150 天，延期之前那段也算在内。美国留学生项目（SEVP）的官方说明写明：SEVIS 记录里没有雇主信息，就按没工作算。累计满 90 天，SEVP 官员可以手动终止这个学生的身份。SEVIS 是美国的留学生身份档案系统。申请时间按美国移民局（USCIS）的页面：毕业前 90 天起可以申请，最晚毕业后 60 天。学校在 SEVIS 里录入推荐以后，30 天内要递上去"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["8 CFR 214.2(f)(10)(ii)(E)、(f)(11)(i)(B). ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-8/chapter-I/subchapter-B/part-214/section-214.2","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-8/chapter-I/subchapter-B/part-214/section-214.2"]},"；U.S. ICE SEVP, SEVIS Help Hub. F-1 Optional Practical Training (OPT). ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://studyinthestates.dhs.gov/sevis-help-hub/student-records/fm-student-employment/f-1-optional-practical-training-opt","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://studyinthestates.dhs.gov/sevis-help-hub/student-records/fm-student-employment/f-1-optional-practical-training-opt"]},"；USCIS. Optional Practical Training (OPT) for F-1 Students. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.uscis.gov/working-in-the-united-states/students-and-exchange-visitors/optional-practical-training-opt-for-f-1-students","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.uscis.gov/working-in-the-united-states/students-and-exchange-visitors/optional-practical-training-opt-for-f-1-students"]},"；DHS (2026). Optional Practical Training Fees（拟议规则，2026-10-08 公布）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/10/08/2026-20660/optional-practical-training-fees","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/10/08/2026-20660/optional-practical-training-fees"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["本条截至 2026 年 10 月 14 日。OPT 的规矩正在变，有两件事要盯。第一，第 2 条（F-1 新规的官司）里那份被暂停的新规，把「毕业后 60 天内申请」改成了 30 天。eCFR 网站上现在显示的就是新规的文字，所以最稳妥的做法是毕业前就把申请递上去。第二，国土安全部 2026 年 10 月 8 日提议对 OPT 收费。第一次 OPT 收 7 万美元，以后每次 3 万美元。这还只是提议，意见征集到 2026 年 11 月 9 日，没有生效。打算读完留在美国工作的，交学费前把这笔可能的钱算进去，递申请前再查一次。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/32-10"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"报名前在留服中心的公告里搜一次学校名，被「加强审查」的学校认证至少要等 60 个工作日"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/32-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"加拿大：申请学签之前，先通过学校拿到省级证明信（PAL/TAL），公立大学读硕士、博士的从 2026 年起不用"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/32-03"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["打工时数是美加英澳四国都写死的红线，超一小时就是违反签证条件"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["四个国家都给学生签证的打工时间定了上限。超了就是违反签证条件。上课期间，美国每周 20 小时，英国读学位每周 20 小时、学位以下 10 小时。加拿大每周 24…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/32-04"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["身份的根是「全日制在读」：休学、退学、转学空档期一律不能打工"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["能不能打工，看你是不是正在全日制上学。一旦休学、退学、被开除，或者转学期间没在上课，打工资格当场就没了。这时候接着干，就是非法打工。签证没到期，不等于还能打工。"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/32-05"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["美国：搬家后 10 天内必须报新地址"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["在美国换了住的地方，法律要求 10 天之内通知移民局。不报不是小事。一来它本身违法，二来移民局寄给你的信可能收不到。"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/32-06"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["出发前和在读期间，看一眼教育部的留学预警"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["教育部会对某个国家或者地区专门发预警，说那里近期的治安或者政策对中国留学生不利。这是官方公开发布的风险提示，白纸黑字能查到，比中介的说法可靠。看一眼不花钱。"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/32-07"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["澳大利亚：OSHC 必须覆盖全程且中间不能断，落地拿不出保险可能被拒绝入境"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["澳大利亚把留学生医疗保险写进了签证条件，不是可买可不买。保险要盖住整个停留期。续签换保单的时候，中间不能有空档。入境时拿不出保险证明，可能当场被拒绝入境。家里人…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/32-08"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["英国：签证费之外还有一笔按年收的医疗附加费，学生每年 776 英镑，申请时一次付清"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["去英国要交的钱不止签证费。还要按签证年数预交医疗附加费，交了才能用英国的国民医疗服务。两年的签证就是一次交 1552 英镑。再加上签证费，出发前这一笔要一次交清…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/32"},"children":["阅读整个主题：出国留学：身份、打工、保险和回国认证 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tabbar","aria-label":"主导航"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/book"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-book-open","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 7v14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["全书"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-star","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0